WEBVTT

00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:04,250
The turmeric root is one of nature's marbles.

00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:08,530
It's been used for thousands of years in Ayurvedic medicine to help maintain normal

00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:13,690
inflammatory balance, cool the GI tract, and calm the immune system.

00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:18,730
As research on turmeric progressed, scientists focused only on harnessing the benefits of one

00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:24,010
active compound, curcumin, but it was quickly discovered that curcumin isn't well absorbed

00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:26,650
by the human gut.

00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:31,490
In order to increase absorption, special technology was developed to help curcumin slip right

00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:35,610
through the gut wall and into the bloodstream.

00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:38,570
But this was never shown to improve clinical efficacy.

00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:43,250
Quickly, it became apparent that more absorption didn't equal better results.

00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,250
But why?

00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:49,450
As scientists investigated this problem, they found turmeric root has other beneficial compounds

00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:53,890
that enhance the function of curcumin, while having benefits of their own.

00:00:53,890 --> 00:00:59,250
It's not just about one turmeric compound, but the complete turmeric matrix.

00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:04,130
It turns out, when this unique group of turmeric compounds is ingested, the gut microbiome

00:01:04,130 --> 00:01:09,250
processes them and makes them bioactive to have the most impact in the body.

00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:14,970
The bioactive turmeric can then neutralize toxins, build microbial diversity, keep inflammatory

00:01:14,970 --> 00:01:18,370
balance in check, and support the immune system.

00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:20,810
Turmeric was never intended to bypass the gut.

00:01:20,810 --> 00:01:22,410
That is where it works best.

00:01:22,890 --> 00:01:28,170
So when choosing a turmeric product, choose one with more than just one compound.

00:01:28,170 --> 00:01:33,090
Choose one that gives you the complete turmeric matrix for full spectrum health benefits.

00:01:33,090 --> 00:01:37,610
Tareva, made with the complete turmeric matrix, has nature intended.

